ty fixes vary by version.\n- **Not legal advice:** have counsel confirm the GPL question for your distribution model.\n\nIf you tell me how you distribute (SaaS or shipped binary) and how `somelib` is used, I can help narrow the GPL risk or look for a replacement.", "commits": [], "branch": "main", "before": {}, "after": {}}}